Explanation: Arca OS rebuilds Zabbly's kernel with Android binder built in (see kernel/README.md).
Explanation: Zabbly's own kernel packages must never be installed; its zfs component stays in use.
Package: linux-image-zabbly linux-zabbly /^linux-(image|headers)-[0-9.]+-zabbly\+(-dbg)?$/
Pin: origin pkgs.zabbly.com
Pin-Priority: -1
